{"3855320": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "ABYSS REBEL", "steam_appid": 3855320, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ABYSS REBEL</strong>Official player group: 972076310</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the most dangerous planet in the entire universe! Depart from an isolated refuge to face ruthless mutant pirates, out-of-control ancient machines, and unspeakable dark creatures of the deep sea… All you can rely on is a small ship and a team of four!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855320/extras/00b026132f67936df1d262fecad293eb.avif?t=1786343874\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Plan every action, crush all your enemies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn the characteristics of your teammates, anticipate each move, and strategize the overall battle. Use skills, buffs, equipment, relics, and environmental mechanics to win fast-paced, intense battles on a classic grid-based battlefield!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855320/extras/d5ec7884de77301c391167f8a9f0cbc5.poster.avif?t=1786343874\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855320/extras/d5ec7884de77301c391167f8a9f0cbc5.webm?t=1786343874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855320/extras/d5ec7884de77301c391167f8a9f0cbc5.mp4?t=1786343874\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiple playable classes, over a hundred character skills</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A diverse system of professions and skills. By learning passive skills linked to active skills, you can modify their mechanics, values, and visual effects. Feel your characters' power grow rapidly in combat!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855320/extras/872dcfae076628a19f3f3bae41120c5a.poster.avif?t=1786343874\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855320/extras/872dcfae076628a19f3f3bae41120c5a.webm?t=1786343874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855320/extras/872dcfae076628a19f3f3bae41120c5a.mp4?t=1786343874\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Open chests, combine hundreds of equipment items</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the classic thrill of looting! Weapons, armor, tools, accessories, mech parts… Strategically combine items with numerical and passive effects with your characters to create a unique team of heroes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855320/extras/9fcacd6e16323cbd583a8f50e0d11598.poster.avif?t=1786343874\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855320/extras/9fcacd6e16323cbd583a8f50e0d11598.webm?t=1786343874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855320/extras/9fcacd6e16323cbd583a8f50e0d11598.mp4?t=1786343874\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mech-Scale Mayhem</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When facing enemies that outnumber you, choose the right moment and summon a mech! Take advantage of area damage upon landing, as well as its exceptional attributes and skills, to turn the situation around at the decisive moment!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855320/extras/a136691824b4cc5069f706c62456ac03.poster.avif?t=1786343874\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855320/extras/a136691824b4cc5069f706c62456ac03.webm?t=1786343874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855320/extras/a136691824b4cc5069f706c62456ac03.mp4?t=1786343874\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Confront the darkness, challenge a wide variety of enemies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Merciless pirate hideouts, perilous ruins and mines, putrid and foul-smelling monster nests… On your journey to the final destination, you will face more than 50 different enemy types, in varied combinations. Only cunning and tactics will allow you to overcome the dangers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855320/extras/afd84f017a4577d713c91d0f95a693d8.poster.avif?t=1786343874\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855320/extras/afd84f017a4577d713c91d0f95a693d8.webm?t=1786343874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855320/extras/afd84f017a4577d713c91d0f95a693d8.mp4?t=1786343874\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ABYSS REBEL</strong>Official player group: 972076310</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the most dangerous planet in the entire universe! Depart from an isolated refuge to face ruthless mutant pirates, out-of-control ancient machines, and unspeakable dark creatures of the deep sea… All you can rely on is a small ship and a team of four!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855320/extras/00b026132f67936df1d262fecad293eb.avif?t=1786343874\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Plan every action, crush all your enemies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn the characteristics of your teammates, anticipate each move, and strategize the overall battle. Use skills, buffs, equipment, relics, and environmental mechanics to win fast-paced, intense battles on a classic grid-based battlefield!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855320/extras/d5ec7884de77301c391167f8a9f0cbc5.poster.avif?t=1786343874\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855320/extras/d5ec7884de77301c391167f8a9f0cbc5.webm?t=1786343874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855320/extras/d5ec7884de77301c391167f8a9f0cbc5.mp4?t=1786343874\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiple playable classes, over a hundred character skills</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A diverse system of professions and skills. By learning passive skills linked to active skills, you can modify their mechanics, values, and visual effects. Feel your characters' power grow rapidly in combat!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855320/extras/872dcfae076628a19f3f3bae41120c5a.poster.avif?t=1786343874\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855320/extras/872dcfae076628a19f3f3bae41120c5a.webm?t=1786343874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855320/extras/872dcfae076628a19f3f3bae41120c5a.mp4?t=1786343874\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Open chests, combine hundreds of equipment items</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the classic thrill of looting! Weapons, armor, tools, accessories, mech parts… Strategically combine items with numerical and passive effects with your characters to create a unique team of heroes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855320/extras/9fcacd6e16323cbd583a8f50e0d11598.poster.avif?t=1786343874\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855320/extras/9fcacd6e16323cbd583a8f50e0d11598.webm?t=1786343874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855320/extras/9fcacd6e16323cbd583a8f50e0d11598.mp4?t=1786343874\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mech-Scale Mayhem</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When facing enemies that outnumber you, choose the right moment and summon a mech! Take advantage of area damage upon landing, as well as its exceptional attributes and skills, to turn the situation around at the decisive moment!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/app